        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ns_note" value="Every service reads the shared JWT secret through External Secrets (IRSA to AWS Secrets Manager), exports OTLP traces to Jaeger on :4317, and exposes metrics that Prometheus scrapes; frontend adds nginx counters on :9113 and :9114.&lt;br&gt;No service keeps durable data: todos live in memory, users in a pod-local H2 database, and Redis is neither persisted nor replicated." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="ns">
