        <mxCell id="controls" value="&lt;b&gt;Per-namespace controls, identical in every environment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;default-deny&lt;/b&gt;: no ingress or egress unless an allowance below grants it&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;allow-dns&lt;/b&gt;: egress to CoreDNS · &lt;b&gt;allow-intra-namespace&lt;/b&gt;: traffic between the namespace's own pods · &lt;b&gt;allow-redis&lt;/b&gt;: the namespace's services to its own Redis&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;allow-load-balancer&lt;/b&gt;: the ALB's public subnets to frontend on :8080 · &lt;b&gt;allow-observability-scrape&lt;/b&gt;: the observability namespace to the metrics ports, :9114 included · &lt;b&gt;allow-tracing-egress&lt;/b&gt;: OTLP to Jaeger on :4317&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;ResourceQuota&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;LimitRange&lt;/b&gt; bound CPU, memory and object counts; the &lt;b&gt;Role&lt;/b&gt; scopes modification rights to the environment; the &lt;b&gt;SecretStore&lt;/b&gt; reads only this environment's secrets through IRSA" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="cluster">
